# CONFIDENTIALITY (SBDD workflow): generated MD parameter files (ffXML) are written
# to the launch directory by covalent/free-ligand parameterisation and DERIVE FROM
# LIGAND CHEMISTRY -- they must never be committed. A hard ignore on all .xml. Already-
# tracked template .xml (gaff2.xml, amberff14SB.xml, ...) are UNAFFECTED, since ignores
# only apply to untracked files; use "git add -f <file>.xml" to track a new one.
*.xml
